              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omugabe Nebukadeneeza yaatangaara, yaimuka n'obwira, yaabuuza abahi b'obwengye be ati: Hari abashaija abu twanaga omu muriro babohirwe baaba batari bashatu? Baamugarukamu bati: Nikwo, Nyakusinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.3.24",
