        },
        {
          "text": " Yaabagira ati: Mbwenu nindeeba abashaija bana batabohirwe, nibagyendagyenda ahagati omu muriro, bataine ku babaire; kandi emishusire y'owa kana neeshusha ey'omwana wa baaruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
