            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nebukadeneeza yairira aha muryango gw'ekikoomi ky'omuriro ogurikubuguma, yaagira ati: Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego, imwe abairu ba Ruhanga orikukira boona, nimushohore, mwije aha. Batyo Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego baaruga omu muriro. ",
          "type": "text",
