            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Nebukadeneeza yaagira ati: Ruhanga wa Seduraaka, Mesaaki na Abedeneego asiimwe; niwe yaayohereza maraika we, akajuna abairu be abaamwesiga, bakahindura busha ekiragiro ky'omugabe, bakooga amagara gaabo okukira okuheereza ruhanga ondiijo otari Ruhanga waabo buzima. ",
          "type": "text",
